<title>USA: Delgratia Mining to resume Nasdaq trading.</title>
<headline>Delgratia Mining to resume Nasdaq trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nasdaq Market said on Thursday it will resume trading in Delgratia Mining Corp on Friday.</p>
<p>The Nasdaq said Delgratia has complied with its request that it issue news releases clarifying corporate announcements.</p>
<p>Nasdaq halted Delgratia on March 21. It last traded at $16 per share.</p>
</text>
